{"title":"Self-hosted server","description":"Run Stirling PDF on your own server with Docker, Kubernetes or Java, then sign in and configure it.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"\n    <h1>Self-hosted server</h1>\n<p>Run Stirling PDF on your own servers, on-premises or with your own cloud provider. Your team uses it in a browser or the desktop app.</p>\n<h2 id=\"pick-a-build\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Pick a build<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#pick-a-build\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Build</th>\n<th>Login and admin settings</th>\n<th>Use it when</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker <code>latest</code></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>You want the standard server. Start here.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker <code>latest-fat</code></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>You also want the AI engine inside the same container. AI stays off until you turn it on.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker <code>latest-ultra-lite</code></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Hardware is limited and you only need the core tools. No OCR or Office conversions.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar</code></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>You can't use Docker and will install Java and the conversion tools yourself.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Stirling-PDF.jar</code></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>As above, for a single user who needs no login.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Stirling-PDF-server.jar</code></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>You only need the <a href=\"/Developers/API/\">REST API</a>. It has no web interface.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Builds without login have no users, single sign-on or admin settings, so everything is set in files or environment variables.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Quick start<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#quick-start\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Start the <code>latest</code> image with the compose file or <code>docker run</code> command in <a href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/#quick-start\">Install with Docker</a>, then open <code>http://localhost:8080</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-login\" class=\"anchor-heading\">First login<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#first-login\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Login is on by default. Sign in with:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Username: admin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Password: stirling</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>You are then asked to set a new password of at least 8 characters. The first admin is also asked whether to send anonymous usage data: see <a href=\"/Server/Analytics-and-Telemetry/\">Analytics and telemetry</a>.</p>\n<p>To create your own first admin instead, set <code>SECURITY_INITIALLOGIN_USERNAME</code> and <code>SECURITY_INITIALLOGIN_PASSWORD</code> before the first start. They are only used while the database has no users.</p>\n<p>To run with no login at all, set <code>SECURITY_ENABLELOGIN=false</code>. Anyone who can reach the server can then use it.</p>\n<p>The free plan covers up to 5 users. Team and Enterprise add seats and features: see <a href=\"/Server/Licensing/Plans-and-Licences/\">Plans and licences</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"next-steps\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Next steps<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#next-steps\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><div class=\"cards cards-3\"><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/\">Install with Docker</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Images, volumes and updates.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><path d=\"M3.27 6.96 12 12.01l8.73-5.05M12 22.08V12\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Install/Kubernetes/\">Install on Kubernetes</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Helm chart and persistence.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6M12 19h8\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Install/JAR/\">Install with Java (JAR)</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Run the JAR without Docker.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Production/\">Production checklist</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>HTTPS, users, backups and monitoring.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21v-7M4 10V3M12 21v-9M12 8V3M20 21v-5M20 12V3M1 14h6M9 8h6M17 16h6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Configuration/\">Configuration</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Settings, files and environment variables.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"5.5\"/><path d=\"m21 2-9.6 9.6M15.5 7.5l3 3L22 7l-3-3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Security/Sign-in-and-Security/\">Sign-in and security</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Login options, email and single sign-on.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.9 5.1L19 10l-5.1 1.9L12 17l-1.9-5.1L5 10l5.1-1.9L12 3z\"/><path d=\"M19 15l.9 2.1L22 18l-2.1.9L19 21l-.9-2.1L16 18l2.1-.9L19 15z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/AI/\">AI on your server</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Turn on the AI assistant and tools.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/Upgrading/\">Upgrading from V1</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>What changes when you move from V1.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/FAQ/\">Server FAQ</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Common admin questions and fixes.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Server.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#pick-a-build\">Pick a build</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#quick-start\">Quick start</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#first-login\">First login</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#next-steps\">Next steps</a></li></ul>","pager":"<span></span><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Docker</span>\n      </a>"}